      "content": "Fair point. I don't want to get flagged for deceptive marketing. Just checking the raw sync... I'm seeing some weirdness in the warehouse logs for the Chrono, like they aren't hitting the front end yet. If we decide to go with the \"low stock\" timer, are we actually safe to say we're running low, or would that be a stretch?",
